  -- That is not a cosmetic gap.  xmonad-contrib's 'multimediaKeys' maps each
  -- name through 'stringToKeysym' and then drops everything that came back
  -- 'noSymbol', so on this backend every one of them disappeared and
  -- EZConfig's <XF86AudioMute> and friends parsed to nothing.  A volume or
  -- brightness key bound in a config did exactly nothing, with no error.
